syn region pythonRawString	matchgroup=Normal start=+[uU]\=[rR]"""+ end=+"""+ contains=conaryMacro,conaryBadMacro
syn region pythonRawString	matchgroup=Normal start=+[uU]\=[rR]'''+ end=+'''+ contains=conaryMacro,conaryBadMacro

